cademy/question-capture/13977622/assets/d61c6dbd94be14f2a455791a584a00f19ab7b52452b3acda984c5b278a5e39ed.png)\n\nSince the second solution ${x}_{2}$ lies in the $3$rd quadrant, we can find it using the reference angle as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & ={180}^{∘}+{\\theta }_{R} \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}+{30}^{∘} \\\\  & ={210}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solutions are $x={150}^{∘},{210}^{∘}.$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=150\\cdot 210=31\\,500.\n$$" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277901 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277902 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277903 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277904 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277905 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1041 "selection" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1104 #edb/ref 17592186277905 13194139534121 true] [17592186277900 1110 #uuid "e61d4e65-ad94-5bbf-8c32-f580e2a746bb" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277901 1034 "9\\,900" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277901 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534121 true] [17592186277901 1111 #uuid "f5b104c4-d1ef-5d68-ad94-4e6b8106760e" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277902 1034 "12\\,150" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277902 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534121 true] [17592186277902 1111 #uuid "522e70ee-798b-5b0d-8704-08d43193ebb7" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277903 1034 "34\\,000" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277903 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534121 true] [17592186277903 1111 #uuid "9db49764-06d5-534d-b50f-55592d0d83ed" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277904 1034 "28\\,800" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277904 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534121 true] [17592186277904 1111 #uuid "566a7d4b-e77e-55ad-83a8-44129c098e1d" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277905 1034 "31\\,500" 13194139534121 true] [17592186277905 1103 #edb